#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
GitLab Java Migration Script

This script helps migrate Java projects from Java 11 to Java 17 by:
1. Updating POM files (Java version and parent POM)
2. Updating GitLab CI configuration
3. Updating Elastic Beanstalk configuration
4. Creating merge requests
5. Managing deployment tags interactively

Usage:
    python3 migration_script.py --projects 101,102,103

Configuration:
    Edit the configuration section below or use command-line arguments.
    Token can be provided via .env file or --token flag.
"""

